IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa-definitions`
IMPORT `coa9-penalties`

-- coa9-strategic.l4: Companies Act 2006 (UK), Part 15 Chapter 4 from s 414C: the strategic report
-- (ss 414C, 414CZA, 414CA, 414CB, 414D), lines 5418-5549 of ukpga-2006-46.txt.
--
-- SOURCE. A plain-text rendering of the Act from legislation.gov.uk made by a converter script; it is not the
-- official text and nothing here is "verified against the official text". Quote lines are checked by srcrefs.py.
--
-- HOW TO READ AN ANSWER (the rule of 2026-10-29 and the rulings of 2026-11-04/05, as the brief states them).
-- Every decision function answers MAYBE BOOLEAN.
--   JUST TRUE   the text says yes to the case.
--   JUST FALSE  the text says no in its own words, or (for a bare "must" that is not met, or an "if" or "where" that
--               fails) the choice recorded in the fork register of NOTES.md. Each such branch carries a comment
--               -- FALSE-kind (...): "<the quoted words>"
--   NOTHING     the text does not decide. Each such branch carries -- NOTHING-kind (<why>), <why> being one of:
--               silent, list not closed, includes, undefined term, points outside the text, limited by its own wording.
--   A caller must never turn NOTHING into FALSE.
-- SEAMS. A fact that another part of the Act decides is an INPUT named for its section (PLAN.md section 4),
-- of type MAYBE BOOLEAN, so that "not covered" there stays "not covered" here.

-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 414C: Contents of strategic report
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 414C Contents of strategic report`

-- (1) "The purpose of the strategic report is to inform members of the company and help them assess how the
-- directors have performed their duty under section 172": a purpose clause that creates no rule. It is a coverage row
-- with disposition inert (reason 1) and has no function. The signpost after (2)(b) ("Section 414CZA ... and sections
-- 414CA and 414CB ... make further provision about the contents of a strategic report") is inert for the same reason.

-- src:5420 | (2) The strategic report must contain—
-- src:5421 | (a) a fair review of the company’s business, and
-- src:5422 | (b) a description of the principal risks and uncertainties facing the company.
@ref s 414C(2) The strategic report must contain a fair review and a description of the principal risks (src:5420-5422)
GIVEN `the strategic report contains a fair review of the company's business` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the strategic report contains a description of the principal risks and uncertainties facing the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(2) the strategic report contains the required items` MEANS
    IF `the strategic report contains a fair review of the company's business`
       AND `the strategic report contains a description of the principal risks and uncertainties facing the company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F1): "The strategic report must contain— (a) a fair review of the company’s business, and (b) a description of the principal risks and uncertainties facing the company."

-- src:5424 | (3) The review required is a balanced and comprehensive analysis of—
-- src:5425 | (a) the development and performance of the company’s business during the financial year, and
-- src:5426 | (b) the position of the company’s business at the end of that year,
-- src:5427 | consistent with the size and complexity of the business.
@ref s 414C(3) The review required is a balanced and comprehensive analysis (src:5424-5427)
GIVEN `the review analyses the development and performance of the company's business during the financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the review analyses the position of the company's business at the end of that year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the analysis is balanced and comprehensive` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the analysis is consistent with the size and complexity of the business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(3) the review is the required balanced and comprehensive analysis` MEANS
    IF `the review analyses the development and performance of the company's business during the financial year`
       AND `the review analyses the position of the company's business at the end of that year`
       AND `the analysis is balanced and comprehensive`
       AND `the analysis is consistent with the size and complexity of the business`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F2): "The review required is a balanced and comprehensive analysis of— (a) the development and performance of the company’s business during the financial year, and (b) the position of the company’s business at the end of that year, consistent with the size and complexity of the business."

-- src:5428 | (4) The review must, to the extent necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company’s business, include—
-- src:5429 | (a) analysis using financial key performance indicators, and
-- src:5430 | (b) where appropriate, analysis using other key performance indicators, including information relating to environmental matters and employee matters.
@ref s 414C(4) The review must include analysis using key performance indicators (src:5428-5430)
GIVEN `analysis using financial key performance indicators is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(4)(a) the review must include analysis using financial key performance indicators` MEANS
    IF `analysis using financial key performance indicators is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company’s business"

@ref s 414C(4) (src:5428)
GIVEN `analysis using other key performance indicators is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is appropriate to analyse using other key performance indicators` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(4)(b) the review must include analysis using other key performance indicators` MEANS
    IF NOT (`it is appropriate to analyse using other key performance indicators`)
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "where appropriate, analysis using other key performance indicators"
    ELSE IF `analysis using other key performance indicators is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business`
         THEN JUST TRUE -- the information includes information relating to environmental matters and employee matters
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company’s business"

-- src:5431 | (5) In subsection (4), “key performance indicators” means factors by reference to which the development, performance or position of the company’s business can be measured effectively.
@ref s 414C(5) Meaning of "key performance indicators" (src:5431)
GIVEN `the development, performance or position of the company's business can be measured effectively by reference to the factor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(5) the factor is a key performance indicator` MEANS
    IF `the development, performance or position of the company's business can be measured effectively by reference to the factor`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“key performance indicators” means factors by reference to which the development, performance or position of the company’s business can be measured effectively"

-- src:5432 | (6) Where a company qualifies as medium-sized in relation to a financial year (see sections 465 to 467), the review for the year need not comply with the requirements of subsection (4) so far as they relate to non-financial information.
@ref s 414C(6) A medium-sized company's review need not comply with subsection (4) as to non-financial information (src:5432)
GIVEN `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(6) the review need not comply with subsection (4) so far as it relates to non-financial information` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b)): "Where a company qualifies as medium-sized in relation to a financial year"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company qualifies as medium-sized is decided by sections 465 to 467

-- (7) and (8): what a quoted company's strategic report must include.
@ref s 414C(6) A medium-sized company's review need not comply with subsection (4) as to non-financial information (src:5432)
DECLARE `s 414C(7) kind of information` IS ONE OF
    `s 414C(7)(a) the main trends and factors likely to affect the future development, performance and position of the company's business`
    `s 414C(7)(b)(i) environmental matters (including the impact of the company's business on the environment)`
    `s 414C(7)(b)(ii) the company's employees`
    `s 414C(7)(b)(iii) social, community and human rights issues`

-- src:5433 | (7) In the case of a quoted company the strategic report must, to the extent necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company’s business, include—
-- src:5434 | (a) the main trends and factors likely to affect the future development, performance and position of the company’s business, and
-- src:5435 | (b) information about—
-- src:5436 | (i) environmental matters (including the impact of the company’s business on the environment),
-- src:5437 | (ii) the company’s employees, and
-- src:5438 | (iii) social, community and human rights issues,
-- src:5439 | including information about any policies of the company in relation to those matters and the effectiveness of those policies.
-- src:5440 | If the report does not contain information of each kind mentioned in paragraphs (b)(i), (ii) and (iii), it must state which of those kinds of information it does not contain.
@ref s 414C(7) A quoted company's strategic report must include trends and information on environmental, employee and social matters (src:5433-5440)
GIVEN `s 385 the company is a quoted company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the information is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business` IS A BOOLEAN
      kind IS A `s 414C(7) kind of information`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(7) the strategic report of a quoted company must include the information` MEANS
    IF `s 385 the company is a quoted company` EQUALS NOTHING
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is a quoted company is decided by section 385
    ELSE IF `s 385 the company is a quoted company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In the case of a quoted company"; a scope limit with no "only" (ruling of 2026-11-05 (c))
         ELSE IF `the information is necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company's business`
              THEN JUST TRUE -- the same for each kind of information in (a) and (b)(i) to (iii); the (b) limbs also cover the company's policies on those matters and their effectiveness
              ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent necessary for an understanding of the development, performance or position of the company’s business"

-- The last sentence of (7): "If the report does not contain information of each kind mentioned in paragraphs (b)(i), (ii) and (iii),
-- it must state which of those kinds of information it does not contain."
@ref s 414C(7) (src:5433)
GIVEN `s 385 the company is a quoted company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the report contains information about environmental matters` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report contains information about the company's employees` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report contains information about social, community and human rights issues` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF `s 414C(7) kind of information`)
`s 414C(7) the kinds of information the report must state it does not contain` MEANS
    IF `s 385 the company is a quoted company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST (filter (GIVEN k YIELD NOT (`the report lacks kind` k)) (LIST `s 414C(7)(b)(i) environmental matters (including the impact of the company's business on the environment)`, `s 414C(7)(b)(ii) the company's employees`, `s 414C(7)(b)(iii) social, community and human rights issues`))
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence belongs to a provision that begins "In the case of a quoted company"
    WHERE
        `the report lacks kind` k MEANS
            CONSIDER k
            WHEN `s 414C(7)(b)(i) environmental matters (including the impact of the company's business on the environment)` THEN `the report contains information about environmental matters`
            WHEN `s 414C(7)(b)(ii) the company's employees` THEN `the report contains information about the company's employees`
            WHEN `s 414C(7)(b)(iii) social, community and human rights issues` THEN `the report contains information about social, community and human rights issues`
            OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref s 414C(7) A quoted company's strategic report must include trends and information on environmental, employee and social matters (src:5433-5440)
DECLARE `s 414C(8) item` IS ONE OF
    `s 414C(8)(a) a description of the company's strategy`
    `s 414C(8)(b) a description of the company's business model`
    `s 414C(8)(c)(i) the number of persons of each sex who were directors of the company`
    `s 414C(8)(c)(ii) the number of persons of each sex who were senior managers of the company`
    `s 414C(8)(c)(iii) the number of persons of each sex who were employees of the company`

-- src:5441 | (8) In the case of a quoted company the strategic report must include—
-- src:5442 | (a) a description of the company’s strategy,
-- src:5443 | (b) a description of the company’s business model,
-- src:5444 | (c) a breakdown showing at the end of the financial year—
-- src:5445 | (i) the number of persons of each sex who were directors of the company;
-- src:5446 | (ii) the number of persons of each sex who were senior managers of the company (other than persons falling within sub-paragraph (i)); and
-- src:5447 | (iii) the number of persons of each sex who were employees of the company.
@ref s 414C(8) A quoted company's strategic report must include strategy, business model and a breakdown by sex (src:5441-5447)
GIVEN `s 385 the company is a quoted company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      item IS A `s 414C(8) item`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(8) the strategic report of a quoted company must include the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 385 the company is a quoted company`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        CONSIDER item -- the breakdown in (c) is shown at the end of the financial year
        WHEN `s 414C(8)(a) a description of the company's strategy` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `s 414C(8)(b) a description of the company's business model` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `s 414C(8)(c)(i) the number of persons of each sex who were directors of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `s 414C(8)(c)(ii) the number of persons of each sex who were senior managers of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
        WHEN `s 414C(8)(c)(iii) the number of persons of each sex who were employees of the company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In the case of a quoted company"; a scope limit with no "only" (ruling of 2026-11-05 (c))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is a quoted company is decided by section 385

-- (8)(c)(ii) "(other than persons falling within sub-paragraph (i))": a senior manager who is also a director is counted
-- under (i), not (ii). The case-by-case ruling of 2026-11-05 covers "(other than X)": fork F3.
@ref s 414C(8)(c)(ii) (src:5446)
GIVEN `the person is a senior manager of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person falls within sub-paragraph (i): is a director of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(8)(c)(ii) the person is counted among the senior managers` MEANS
    IF `the person falls within sub-paragraph (i): is a director of the company`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind ("(other than X)" read as an exclusion, fork F3): "(other than persons falling within sub-paragraph (i))"
    ELSE IF `the person is a senior manager of the company`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): sub-paragraph (ii) counts senior managers and says nothing of other persons

-- src:5448 | (9) In subsection (8), “senior manager” means a person who—
-- src:5449 | (a) has responsibility for planning, directing or controlling the activities of the company, or a strategically significant part of the company, and
-- src:5450 | (b) is an employee of the company.
@ref s 414C(9) Meaning of "senior manager" (src:5448-5450)
GIVEN `the person has responsibility for planning, directing or controlling the activities of the company, or a strategically significant part of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an employee of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(9) the person is a senior manager` MEANS
    IF `the person has responsibility for planning, directing or controlling the activities of the company, or a strategically significant part of the company`
       AND `the person is an employee of the company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“senior manager” means a person who— (a) has responsibility for planning, directing or controlling the activities of the company, or a strategically significant part of the company, and (b) is an employee of the company"

@ref s 414C(9) Meaning of "senior manager" (src:5448-5450)
DECLARE `s 414C(10)(a) whose directors the breakdown counts` IS ONE OF
    `s 414C(10)(a) the parent company`

-- src:5451 | (10) In relation to a group strategic report—
-- src:5452 | (a) the reference to the company in subsection (8)(c)(i) is to the parent company; and
-- src:5453 | (b) the breakdown required by subsection (8)(c)(ii) must include the number of persons of each sex who were the directors of the undertakings included in the consolidation.
@ref s 414C(10) In relation to a group strategic report (src:5451-5453)
GIVEN `the report is a group strategic report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE (`s 414C(10)(a) whose directors the breakdown counts`)
`s 414C(10)(a) whose directors are counted under subsection (8)(c)(i)` MEANS
    IF `the report is a group strategic report`
    THEN JUST `s 414C(10)(a) the parent company`
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In relation to a group strategic report"; for any other report subsection (8)(c)(i) itself speaks of the directors of the company

@ref s 414C(10) (src:5451)
GIVEN `the report is a group strategic report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(10)(b) the breakdown under subsection (8)(c)(ii) must include the directors of the undertakings included in the consolidation` MEANS
    IF `the report is a group strategic report`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In relation to a group strategic report"

-- src:5454 | (11) The strategic report may also contain such of the matters otherwise required by regulations made under section 416(4) to be disclosed in the directors’ report as the directors consider are of strategic importance to the company.
@ref s 414C(11) The strategic report may also contain matters otherwise required in the directors' report (src:5454)
GIVEN `the matter is one otherwise required by regulations made under section 416(4) to be disclosed in the directors' report` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the directors consider the matter is of strategic importance to the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(11) the strategic report may also contain the matter` MEANS
    IF `the matter is one otherwise required by regulations made under section 416(4) to be disclosed in the directors' report`
       AND `the directors consider the matter is of strategic importance to the company`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "such of the matters otherwise required ... as the directors consider are of strategic importance"; "may also contain" does not forbid other matters

-- src:5455 | (12) The report must, where appropriate, include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company’s annual accounts.
@ref s 414C(12) The report must, where appropriate, include references to and explanations of amounts in the annual accounts (src:5455)
GIVEN `it is appropriate to include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company's annual accounts` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(12) the report must include references to and additional explanations of amounts in the annual accounts` MEANS
    IF `it is appropriate to include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company's annual accounts`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "where appropriate"

-- src:5456 | (13) Subject to paragraph (10), in relation to a group strategic report this section has effect as if the references to the company were references to the undertakings included in the consolidation.
@ref s 414C(13) In a group strategic report the section is read as if the company meant the undertakings included in the consolidation (src:5456)
GIVEN `the report is a group strategic report` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the reference to the company is the one in subsection (8)(c)(i), which paragraph (10) governs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(13) a reference to the company in this section is read as a reference to the undertakings included in the consolidation` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the report is a group strategic report`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in relation to a group strategic report"
    ELSE IF `the reference to the company is the one in subsection (8)(c)(i), which paragraph (10) governs`
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind ("Subject to X" read as an exception once it is met, fork F4): "Subject to paragraph (10)"
         ELSE JUST TRUE

-- src:5457 | (14) Nothing in this section requires the disclosure of information about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation if the disclosure would, in the opinion of the directors, be seriously prejudicial to the interests of the company.
@ref s 414C(14) Nothing in this section requires disclosure of impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation (src:5457)
GIVEN `the information is about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the opinion of the directors the disclosure would be seriously prejudicial to the interests of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414C(14) this section requires the disclosure of the information` MEANS
    IF `the information is about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation`
       AND `in the opinion of the directors the disclosure would be seriously prejudicial to the interests of the company`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section requires the disclosure of information about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation if the disclosure would, in the opinion of the directors, be seriously prejudicial to the interests of the company"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection removes a requirement in one case and says nothing of the others

-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 414CZA: Section 172(1) statement
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 414CZA Section 172(1) statement`

-- src:5458 | 414CZA Section 172(1) statement
-- src:5459 | (1) A strategic report for a financial year of a company must include a statement (a “section 172(1) statement”) which describes how the directors have had regard to the matters set out in section 172(1)(a) to (f) when performing their duty under section 172.
@ref s 414CZA(1) A strategic report must include a section 172(1) statement (src:5458-5459)
GIVEN `the statement describes how the directors have had regard to the matters set out in section 172(1)(a) to (f) when performing their duty under section 172` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CZA(1) the statement is a section 172(1) statement` MEANS
    IF `the statement describes how the directors have had regard to the matters set out in section 172(1)(a) to (f) when performing their duty under section 172`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a statement (a “section 172(1) statement”) which describes how the directors have had regard to the matters set out in section 172(1)(a) to (f) when performing their duty under section 172"

@ref s 414CZA(1) (src:5459)
GIVEN `the strategic report includes a statement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 414CZA(1) the statement is a section 172(1) statement` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CZA(1) the strategic report includes the required section 172(1) statement` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the strategic report includes a statement`)
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F5): "A strategic report for a financial year of a company must include a statement"
    ELSE `s 414CZA(1) the statement is a section 172(1) statement`

-- src:5460 | (2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the company qualifies as medium-sized in relation to that financial year (see sections 465 to 467).
@ref s 414CZA(2) Subsection (1) does not apply to a medium-sized company (src:5460)
GIVEN `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CZA(2) subsection (1) does not apply to the company` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "does not apply if the company qualifies as medium-sized in relation to that financial year"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company qualifies as medium-sized is decided by sections 465 to 467

-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 414CA: Non-financial and sustainability information statement
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 414CA Non-financial and sustainability information statement`

-- Which of (A1), (1), (1A), (1B) a caller asks: (A1) is the duty, (1) and (1A) are the two routes in, (3) to (8) are the ways out,
-- and (1B) says that the routes in are subject to the ways out. Section 414CA(7)(b) and (9) are blank in this text.

-- src:5462 | (A1) A strategic report of a company to which this subsection applies must include a non-financial and sustainability information statement.
@ref s 414CA(A1) A strategic report of a company to which this subsection applies must include the statement (src:5462)
GIVEN `s 414CA(1B) subsection (A1) applies to the company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the strategic report includes a non-financial and sustainability information statement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(A1) the strategic report includes the required non-financial and sustainability information statement` MEANS
    IF `s 414CA(1B) subsection (A1) applies to the company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN IF `the strategic report includes a non-financial and sustainability information statement`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F6): "A strategic report of a company to which this subsection applies must include a non-financial and sustainability information statement."
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "of a company to which this subsection applies"

-- src:5463 | (1) Subsection (A1) applies to a company if it was at any time within the financial year to which the report relates—
-- src:5464 | (a) a traded company,
-- src:5465 | (b) a banking company,
-- src:5466 | (c) an authorised insurance company, ...
-- src:5467 | (d) a company carrying on insurance market activity or
-- src:5468 | (e) a company any securities of which are admitted to trading on the market known as the Alternative Investment Market.
@ref s 414CA(1) Subsection (A1) applies to a company of these kinds (src:5463-5468)
-- SEAMS (PLAN 4.1/4.2): sections 360C, 1164(2) and 1165(2). The caller answers each for the text's time frame: "at any time within the financial year to which the report relates".
GIVEN `s 360C the company is a traded company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 1164(2) the person is a banking company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 1165(2) the person is an authorised insurance company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company carries on insurance market activity at any time within the financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described` MEANS
    IF `s 1164(2) the person is a banking company`
       OR `s 1165(2) the person is an authorised insurance company`
       OR `the company carries on insurance market activity at any time within the financial year`
       OR `s 360C the company is a traded company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `s 360C the company is a traded company` EQUALS NOTHING
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is a traded company is decided by section 360C
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) applies to a company if it was at any time within the financial year to which the report relates— (a) a traded company, (b) a banking company, (c) an authorised insurance company, ... (d) a company carrying on insurance market activity"

@ref s 414CA(1) (src:5463)
GIVEN `s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `any securities of the company were admitted to trading on the Alternative Investment Market at any time within the financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(1) subsection (A1) applies to the company because of its kind` MEANS
    IF `any securities of the company were admitted to trading on the Alternative Investment Market at any time within the financial year`
       OR `s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described` EQUALS NOTHING
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): paragraph (a) rests on section 360C
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) applies to a company if it was at any time within the financial year to which the report relates— ... (e) a company any securities of which are admitted to trading on the market known as the Alternative Investment Market"

-- src:5469 | (1A) Subsection (A1) also applies to a company if it was a high turnover company in relation to that financial year.
@ref s 414CA(1A) Subsection (A1) also applies to a high turnover company (src:5469)
GIVEN `s 414CA(2A) the company is a high turnover company in relation to the financial year` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(1A) subsection (A1) also applies to the company because it was a high turnover company` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 414CA(2A) the company is a high turnover company in relation to the financial year`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) also applies to a company if it was a high turnover company in relation to that financial year"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the turnover test in subsection (2A) was not answered

-- src:5470 | (1B) Subsections (1) and (1A) are subject to subsections (3) to (7).
@ref s 414CA(1B) Subsections (1) and (1A) are subject to subsections (3) to (7) (src:5470)
GIVEN `s 414CA(1) subsection (A1) applies to the company because of its kind` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 414CA(1A) subsection (A1) also applies to the company because it was a high turnover company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 414CA(3) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the company's size` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 414CA(4) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the number of employees` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 414CA(7) subsection (A1) does not apply because the company is included in a group strategic report` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(1B) subsection (A1) applies to the company` MEANS
    IF `s 414CA(3) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the company's size` EQUALS JUST TRUE
       OR `s 414CA(4) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the number of employees` EQUALS JUST TRUE
       OR `s 414CA(7) subsection (A1) does not apply because the company is included in a group strategic report` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company if"; "Subsections (1) and (1A) are subject to subsections (3) to (7)"
    ELSE IF `s 414CA(1) subsection (A1) applies to the company because of its kind` EQUALS JUST TRUE
            OR `s 414CA(1A) subsection (A1) also applies to the company because it was a high turnover company` EQUALS JUST TRUE
         THEN IF `s 414CA(3) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the company's size` EQUALS NOTHING
                 OR `s 414CA(4) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the number of employees` EQUALS NOTHING
                 OR `s 414CA(7) subsection (A1) does not apply because the company is included in a group strategic report` EQUALS NOTHING
              THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): an exclusion in subsection (3), (4) or (7) was not answered
              ELSE JUST TRUE
         ELSE IF `s 414CA(1) subsection (A1) applies to the company because of its kind` EQUALS JUST FALSE
                 AND `s 414CA(1A) subsection (A1) also applies to the company because it was a high turnover company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
              THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) applies to a company if" (subsection (1)); "Subsection (A1) also applies to a company if" (subsection (1A))
              ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): subsection (1) or (1A) was not answered

-- src:5471 | (2) If the company’s strategic report is a group strategic report, the non-financial and sustainability information statement to be included in the report under subsection (A1) must be a consolidated statement (a “group non-financial and sustainability information statement”) relating to the undertakings included in the consolidation.
@ref s 414CA(2) A group strategic report carries a consolidated statement (src:5471)
GIVEN `the company's strategic report is a group strategic report` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(2) the statement must be a consolidated group non-financial and sustainability information statement` MEANS
    IF `the company's strategic report is a group strategic report`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer; fork F33): "If the company’s strategic report is a group strategic report, the non-financial and sustainability information statement ... must be a consolidated statement"

-- (2A) to (2D): the turnover test. The pounds are the Act's own (£500 million). (2B) adjusts them for a period that is a
-- financial year but not a year; "proportionately adjusted" does not say by what measure (months or days): fork F7.
-- src:5472 | (2A) A company is a “high turnover company” in relation to a financial year—
-- src:5473 | (a) where the company was not a parent company in that financial year, if in that year the company’s turnover was more than £500 million;
-- src:5474 | (b) where the company was a parent company at any time within that financial year, if in that year a group headed by the company had an aggregate turnover of more than £500 million net.
-- src:5475 | (2B) For a period that is a company’s financial year but not in fact a year the figures for turnover given by subsection (2A) must be proportionately adjusted.
@ref s 414CA(2A) Meaning of "high turnover company"; (2B) proportionate adjustment (src:5472-5475)
GIVEN `the length of the period as a proportion of a year (1 for a year, 0.5 for six months)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 414CA(2B) the turnover threshold of £500 million adjusted to the length of the financial year` MEANS
    500_000_000 TIMES `the length of the period as a proportion of a year (1 for a year, 0.5 for six months)`

-- SEAM (PLAN 4.1): section 1173(1). The caller answers it for the text's time frame: "at any time within that financial year".
@ref s 414CA(2A) (src:5472)
GIVEN `s 1173(1) the company is a parent company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the company's own turnover in that year, in pounds` IS A NUMBER
      `s 383(6) the aggregate turnover of the group headed by the company, net, in pounds` IS A NUMBER
      `the length of the period as a proportion of a year (1 for a year, 0.5 for six months)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(2A) the company is a high turnover company in relation to the financial year` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 1173(1) the company is a parent company`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company was a parent company is decided by section 1173(1)
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN
        IF `the company's own turnover in that year, in pounds` GREATER THAN `s 414CA(2B) the turnover threshold of £500 million adjusted to the length of the financial year` `the length of the period as a proportion of a year (1 for a year, 0.5 for six months)`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(a) where the company was not a parent company in that financial year, if in that year the company’s turnover was more than £500 million"
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        IF `s 383(6) the aggregate turnover of the group headed by the company, net, in pounds` GREATER THAN `s 414CA(2B) the turnover threshold of £500 million adjusted to the length of the financial year` `the length of the period as a proportion of a year (1 for a year, 0.5 for six months)`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) where the company was a parent company at any time within that financial year, if in that year a group headed by the company had an aggregate turnover of more than £500 million net"

-- src:5476 | (2C) For the purposes of subsection (2A)(b)—
-- src:5477 | (a) aggregate turnover is ascertained by aggregating the relevant figures determined for each member of the group;
-- src:5478 | (b) “net”, in relation to aggregate turnover, is to be interpreted in accordance with section 383(6).
@ref s 414CA(2C) How the aggregate turnover of a group is ascertained (src:5476-5478)
GIVEN `the relevant figures determined for each member of the group, in pounds` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 414CA(2C)(a) the aggregate turnover of the group` MEANS
    sum `the relevant figures determined for each member of the group, in pounds`

-- (2C)(b): "net" is interpreted in accordance with section 383(6), which belongs to another part; the figure that reaches
-- s 414CA(2A)(b) is therefore taken as an input, named for that section: s 383(6) the aggregate turnover ... net.

-- src:5479 | (2D) Section 383(7) applies for the purposes of subsection (2A)(b) of this section as it applies for the purposes of section 383.
@ref s 414CA(2D) Section 383(7) applies for the purposes of subsection (2A)(b) (src:5479)
GIVEN `the purpose is subsection (2A)(b) of section 414CA` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(2D) section 383(7) applies for the purpose` MEANS
    IF `the purpose is subsection (2A)(b) of section 414CA`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for the purposes of subsection (2A)(b) of this section"

-- src:5480 | (3) Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company if—
-- src:5481 | (a) the company is subject to the small companies regime in relation to that financial year (see sections 382 to 384), or
-- src:5482 | (b) the company qualifies as medium-sized in relation to that financial year (see sections 465 to 467).
@ref s 414CA(3) Subsection (A1) does not apply to a small or medium-sized company (src:5480-5482)
GIVEN `s 382 the company is subject to the small companies regime in relation to that financial year` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(3) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the company's size` MEANS
    IF `s 382 the company is subject to the small companies regime in relation to that financial year` EQUALS JUST TRUE
       OR `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `s 382 the company is subject to the small companies regime in relation to that financial year` EQUALS JUST FALSE
            AND `s 465 the company qualifies as medium-sized` EQUALS JUST FALSE
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company if— (a) the company is subject to the small companies regime ..., or (b) the company qualifies as medium-sized"
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): sections 382 to 384 or 465 to 467 were not answered

-- src:5483 | (4) Subsection (A1) does not apply—
-- src:5484 | (a) to a company which was not a parent company in that financial year, if the company had no more than 500 employees in that financial year, or
-- src:5485 | (b) to a company which was a parent company at any time within that financial year, if the aggregate number of employees for a group headed by that company in that financial year was no more than 500.
@ref s 414CA(4) Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company with no more than 500 employees (src:5483-5485)
-- SEAM (PLAN 4.1): section 1173(1). The caller answers it for the text's time frame: "at any time within that financial year".
GIVEN `s 1173(1) the company is a parent company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the number of employees of the company in that financial year` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate number of employees for the group headed by the company in that financial year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(4) subsection (A1) does not apply because of the number of employees` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 1173(1) the company is a parent company`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company was a parent company is decided by section 1173(1)
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN
        IF `the number of employees of the company in that financial year` AT MOST 500
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "(a) to a company which was not a parent company in that financial year, if the company had no more than 500 employees in that financial year"
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        IF `the aggregate number of employees for the group headed by the company in that financial year` AT MOST 500
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "(b) to a company which was a parent company at any time within that financial year, if the aggregate number of employees for a group headed by that company in that financial year was no more than 500"

-- src:5486 | (5) The number of employees means the average number of persons employed by the company in the year, determined as follows—
-- src:5487 | (a) find for each month in the financial year the number of persons employed under contracts of service by the company in that month (whether throughout the month or not),
-- src:5488 | (b) add together the monthly totals, and
-- src:5489 | (c) divide by the number of months in the financial year.
@ref s 414CA(5) The number of employees is the average over the months of the financial year (src:5486-5489)
GIVEN `the number of persons employed under contracts of service by the company in each month of the financial year (whether throughout the month or not)` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 414CA(5) the number of employees` MEANS
    IF count `the number of persons employed under contracts of service by the company in each month of the financial year (whether throughout the month or not)` EQUALS 0
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): step (c) divides by the number of months in the financial year, and a financial year has at least one month
    ELSE JUST (sum `the number of persons employed under contracts of service by the company in each month of the financial year (whether throughout the month or not)` DIVIDED BY count `the number of persons employed under contracts of service by the company in each month of the financial year (whether throughout the month or not)`)

-- src:5490 | (6) The aggregate number of employees for a group is ascertained by aggregating the relevant figures determined in accordance with subsection (5) for each member of the group.
@ref s 414CA(6) The aggregate number of employees for a group (src:5490)
GIVEN `the number of employees of each member of the group, each determined in accordance with subsection (5)` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 414CA(6) the aggregate number of employees for the group` MEANS
    sum `the number of employees of each member of the group, each determined in accordance with subsection (5)`

-- src:5491 | (7) Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company if the company is a subsidiary undertaking at the end of that financial year and is included in—
-- src:5492 | (a) a group strategic report of a parent undertaking of the company that satisfies the requirements in subsection (8), ...
-- src:5493 | (b) . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .
@ref s 414CA(7) Subsection (A1) does not apply to a subsidiary undertaking included in a group strategic report (src:5491-5493)
GIVEN `the company is a subsidiary undertaking at the end of that financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company is included in a group strategic report of a parent undertaking of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 414CA(8) the requirements in this subsection are satisfied` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(7) subsection (A1) does not apply because the company is included in a group strategic report` MEANS
    IF `the company is a subsidiary undertaking at the end of that financial year`
       AND `the company is included in a group strategic report of a parent undertaking of the company`
       AND `s 414CA(8) the requirements in this subsection are satisfied` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `s 414CA(8) the requirements in this subsection are satisfied` EQUALS NOTHING
            AND `the company is a subsidiary undertaking at the end of that financial year`
            AND `the company is included in a group strategic report of a parent undertaking of the company`
         THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the requirements in subsection (8) were not answered
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "Subsection (A1) does not apply to a company if the company is a subsidiary undertaking at the end of that financial year and is included in— (a) a group strategic report of a parent undertaking of the company that satisfies the requirements in subsection (8)"

-- src:5494 | (8) The requirements in this subsection are that—
-- src:5495 | (a) the group strategic report relates to undertakings that include the company and its subsidiary undertakings (if any),
-- src:5496 | (b) the report is prepared for a financial year of the parent undertaking that ends at the same time as, or before the end of, the company’s financial year, and
-- src:5497 | (c) the report includes a group non-financial and sustainability information statement in respect of all the undertakings included in the consolidation.
@ref s 414CA(8) The requirements for the group strategic report (src:5494-5497)
GIVEN `the group strategic report relates to undertakings that include the company and its subsidiary undertakings (if any)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report is prepared for a financial year of the parent undertaking that ends at the same time as, or before the end of, the company's financial year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the report includes a group non-financial and sustainability information statement in respect of all the undertakings included in the consolidation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(8) the requirements in this subsection are satisfied` MEANS
    IF `the group strategic report relates to undertakings that include the company and its subsidiary undertakings (if any)`
       AND `the report is prepared for a financial year of the parent undertaking that ends at the same time as, or before the end of, the company's financial year`
       AND `the report includes a group non-financial and sustainability information statement in respect of all the undertakings included in the consolidation`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The requirements in this subsection are that— (a) ..., (b) ... and (c) ..."

-- src:5499 | (10) A company to which subsection (A1) does not apply may include a non-financial and sustainability information statement in its strategic report or, as the case may be, a group non-financial and sustainability information statement in its group strategic report.
@ref s 414CA(10) A company to which subsection (A1) does not apply may include a statement (src:5499)
GIVEN `s 414CA(1B) subsection (A1) applies to the company` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CA(10) the company may include a non-financial and sustainability information statement in its strategic report` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 414CA(1B) subsection (A1) applies to the company`
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A company to which subsection (A1) does not apply may include"; a company to which it applies is under the duty in (A1) itself
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether subsection (A1) applies was not answered

-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 414CB: Contents of non-financial and sustainability information statement
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 414CB Contents of non-financial and sustainability information statement`

@ref s 414CA(10) A company to which subsection (A1) does not apply may include a statement (src:5499)
DECLARE `s 414CB(2A) kind of climate-related financial disclosure` IS ONE OF
    `s 414CB(2A)(a) governance arrangements in relation to assessing and managing climate-related risks and opportunities`
    `s 414CB(2A)(b) how the company identifies, assesses and manages climate-related risks and opportunities`
    `s 414CB(2A)(c) how those processes are integrated into the company's overall risk management process`
    `s 414CB(2A)(d) the principal climate-related risks and opportunities and the time periods by reference to which they are assessed`
    `s 414CB(2A)(e) the actual and potential impacts of the principal climate-related risks and opportunities on the business model and strategy`
    `s 414CB(2A)(f) the resilience of the business model and strategy in different climate-related scenarios`
    `s 414CB(2A)(g) the targets used to manage climate-related risks and to realise opportunities, and performance against them`
    `s 414CB(2A)(h) the key performance indicators used to assess progress against those targets, and the calculations behind them`
    `s 414CB(2A) another kind of disclosure`

-- src:5516 | (2A) In this section, “climate-related financial disclosures” mean—
-- src:5517 | (a) a description of the company’s governance arrangements in relation to assessing and managing climate-related risks and opportunities;
-- src:5518 | (b) a description of how the company identifies, assesses, and manages climate-related risks and opportunities;
-- src:5519 | (c) a description of how processes for identifying, assessing, and managing climate-related risks are integrated into the company’s overall risk management process;
-- src:5520 | (d) a description of—
-- src:5521 | (i) the principal climate-related risks and opportunities arising in connection with the company’s operations, and
-- src:5522 | (ii) the time periods by reference to which those risks and opportunities are assessed;
-- src:5523 | (e) a description of the actual and potential impacts of the principal climate-related risks and opportunities on the company’s business model and strategy;
-- src:5524 | (f) an analysis of the resilience of the company’s business model and strategy, taking into consideration different climate-related scenarios;
-- src:5525 | (g) a description of the targets used by the company to manage climate-related risks and to realise climate-related opportunities and of performance against those targets; and
-- src:5526 | (h) a description of the key performance indicators used to assess progress against targets used to manage climate-related risks and realise climate-related opportunities and of the calculations on which those key performance indicators are based.
@ref s 414CB(2A) Meaning of "climate-related financial disclosures" (src:5516-5526)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 414CB(2A) kind of climate-related financial disclosure`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(2A) the disclosure is one of the climate-related financial disclosures` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 414CB(2A) another kind of disclosure` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“climate-related financial disclosures” mean— (a) ... (h)"; a definition that says "mean" and lists eight kinds
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:5501 | (A1) The non-financial and sustainability information statement must contain the climate-related financial disclosures of the company.
@ref s 414CB(A1) The statement must contain the climate-related financial disclosures of the company (src:5501)
GIVEN `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains` IS A LIST OF `s 414CB(2A) kind of climate-related financial disclosure`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(A1) the statement contains the climate-related financial disclosures` MEANS
    IF     elem `s 414CB(2A)(a) governance arrangements in relation to assessing and managing climate-related risks and opportunities` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(b) how the company identifies, assesses and manages climate-related risks and opportunities` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(c) how those processes are integrated into the company's overall risk management process` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(d) the principal climate-related risks and opportunities and the time periods by reference to which they are assessed` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(e) the actual and potential impacts of the principal climate-related risks and opportunities on the business model and strategy` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(f) the resilience of the business model and strategy in different climate-related scenarios` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(g) the targets used to manage climate-related risks and to realise opportunities, and performance against them` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
       AND elem `s 414CB(2A)(h) the key performance indicators used to assess progress against those targets, and the calculations behind them` `the kinds of climate-related financial disclosure the statement contains`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F8): "The non-financial and sustainability information statement must contain the climate-related financial disclosures of the company."

@ref s 414CB(A1) The statement must contain the climate-related financial disclosures of the company (src:5501)
DECLARE `s 414CB(1) matter` IS ONE OF
    `s 414CB(1)(a) environmental matters (including the impact of the company's business on the environment)`
    `s 414CB(1)(b) the company's employees`
    `s 414CB(1)(c) social matters`
    `s 414CB(1)(d) respect for human rights`
    `s 414CB(1)(e) anti-corruption and anti-bribery matters`

-- src:5502 | (1) If the company is of a kind described in section 414CA(1)(a), (b), (c) or (d), the non-financial and sustainability information statement must contain information, to the extent necessary for an understanding of the company’s development, performance and position and the impact of its activity, relating to, as a minimum—
-- src:5503 | (a) environmental matters (including the impact of the company’s business on the environment),
-- src:5504 | (b) the company’s employees,
-- src:5505 | (c) social matters,
-- src:5506 | (d) respect for human rights, and
-- src:5507 | (e) anti-corruption and anti-bribery matters.
@ref s 414CB(1) The statement must contain information on these matters as a minimum (src:5502-5507)
GIVEN `s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the information on the matter is necessary for an understanding of the company's development, performance and position and the impact of its activity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(1) the statement must contain information on the matter` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 414CA(1)(a) to (d) the company is of a kind described`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the company is of a kind described in section 414CA(1)(a) to (d) rests on section 360C
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer; fork F33): "If the company is of a kind described in section 414CA(1)(a), (b), (c) or (d), the non-financial and sustainability information statement must contain information"
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        IF `the information on the matter is necessary for an understanding of the company's development, performance and position and the impact of its activity`
        THEN JUST TRUE -- the same for each of the five matters in (a) to (e)
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent necessary for an understanding of the company’s development, performance and position and the impact of its activity"

@ref s 414CB(1) The statement must contain information on these matters as a minimum (src:5502-5507)
DECLARE `s 414CB(2) item of information` IS ONE OF
    `s 414CB(2)(a) a brief description of the company's business model`
    `s 414CB(2)(b) a description of the policies pursued in relation to the matters in subsection (1)(a) to (e) and any due diligence processes`
    `s 414CB(2)(c) a description of the outcome of those policies`
    `s 414CB(2)(d) a description of the principal risks relating to those matters arising in connection with the company's operations`
    `s 414CB(2)(d)(i) a description of business relationships, products and services likely to cause adverse impacts in those areas of risk`
    `s 414CB(2)(d)(ii) a description of how the company manages the principal risks`
    `s 414CB(2)(e) a description of the non-financial key performance indicators relevant to the company's business`

-- src:5508 | (2) The information required by subsection (1) must include—
-- src:5509 | (a) a brief description of the company’s business model,
-- src:5510 | (b) a description of the policies pursued by the company in relation to the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e) and any due diligence processes implemented by the company in pursuance of those policies,
-- src:5511 | (c) a description of the outcome of those policies,
-- src:5512 | (d) a description of the principal risks relating to the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e) arising in connection with the company’s operations and, where relevant and proportionate—
-- src:5513 | (i) a description of its business relationships, products and services which are likely to cause adverse impacts in those areas of risk, and
-- src:5514 | (ii) a description of how it manages the principal risks, and
-- src:5515 | (e) a description of the non-financial key performance indicators relevant to the company’s business.
@ref s 414CB(2) The information required by subsection (1) must include (src:5508-5515)
GIVEN `the information is required by subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `where relevant and proportionate` IS A BOOLEAN
      item IS A `s 414CB(2) item of information`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(2) the information required by subsection (1) must include the item` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the information is required by subsection (1)`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The information required by subsection (1)"
    ELSE CONSIDER item
         WHEN `s 414CB(2)(d)(i) a description of business relationships, products and services likely to cause adverse impacts in those areas of risk` THEN
             IF `where relevant and proportionate` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "where relevant and proportionate"
         WHEN `s 414CB(2)(d)(ii) a description of how the company manages the principal risks` THEN
             IF `where relevant and proportionate` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "where relevant and proportionate"
         OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:5527 | (3) In subsection (2)(e), “key performance indicators” means factors by reference to which the development, performance or position of the company’s business, or the impact of the company’s activity, can be measured effectively.
@ref s 414CB(3) Meaning of "key performance indicators" in subsection (2)(e) (src:5527)
GIVEN `the development, performance or position of the company's business, or the impact of the company's activity, can be measured effectively by reference to the factor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(3) the factor is a key performance indicator` MEANS
    IF `the development, performance or position of the company's business, or the impact of the company's activity, can be measured effectively by reference to the factor`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“key performance indicators” means factors by reference to which the development, performance or position of the company’s business, or the impact of the company’s activity, can be measured effectively"

-- src:5528 | (4) If the company does not pursue policies in relation to one or more of the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e), the statement must provide a clear and reasoned explanation for the company’s not doing so.
@ref s 414CB(4) A company that pursues no policy on a matter must explain why (src:5528)
GIVEN `the company does not pursue policies in relation to one or more of the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(4) the statement must provide a clear and reasoned explanation for the company's not pursuing policies` MEANS
    IF `the company does not pursue policies in relation to one or more of the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer; fork F33): "If the company does not pursue policies in relation to one or more of the matters mentioned in subsection (1)(a) to (e), the statement must provide a clear and reasoned explanation"

-- src:5529 | (4A) Where the directors of a company reasonably believe that, having regard to the nature of the company’s business, and the manner in which it is carried on, the whole or a part of a climate-related financial disclosure required by subsection (2A)(e), (f), (g) or (h) is not necessary for an understanding of the company’s business, the directors may omit the whole or (as the case requires) the relevant part of that climate-related financial disclosure.
@ref s 414CB(4A) The directors may omit a disclosure they reasonably believe is not necessary (src:5529)
GIVEN kind IS A `s 414CB(2A) kind of climate-related financial disclosure`
      `the directors reasonably believe that, having regard to the nature of the company's business and the manner in which it is carried on, the whole or a part of the disclosure is not necessary for an understanding of the company's business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(4A) the directors may omit the disclosure or the relevant part of it` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 414CB(2A)(e) the actual and potential impacts of the principal climate-related risks and opportunities on the business model and strategy` THEN `the belief decides`
    WHEN `s 414CB(2A)(f) the resilience of the business model and strategy in different climate-related scenarios` THEN `the belief decides`
    WHEN `s 414CB(2A)(g) the targets used to manage climate-related risks and to realise opportunities, and performance against them` THEN `the belief decides`
    WHEN `s 414CB(2A)(h) the key performance indicators used to assess progress against those targets, and the calculations behind them` THEN `the belief decides`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the permission names the disclosures required by subsection (2A)(e), (f), (g) or (h) and says nothing of the others
    WHERE
        `the belief decides` MEANS
            IF `the directors reasonably believe that, having regard to the nature of the company's business and the manner in which it is carried on, the whole or a part of the disclosure is not necessary for an understanding of the company's business`
            THEN JUST TRUE
            ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "Where the directors of a company reasonably believe that"

-- src:5530 | (4B) Where the directors omit the whole or part of a climate-related financial disclosure in reliance on subsection (4A)the non-financial and sustainability information statement must provide a clear and reasoned explanation of the directors’ reasonable belief mentioned in that subsection.
@ref s 414CB(4B) The statement must explain the directors' belief where a disclosure is omitted (src:5530)
GIVEN `the directors omit the whole or part of a climate-related financial disclosure in reliance on subsection (4A)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(4B) the statement must provide a clear and reasoned explanation of the directors' reasonable belief` MEANS
    IF `the directors omit the whole or part of a climate-related financial disclosure in reliance on subsection (4A)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "Where the directors omit the whole or part of a climate-related financial disclosure in reliance on subsection (4A)"

-- src:5531 | (5) The statement must, where appropriate, include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company’s annual accounts.
@ref s 414CB(5) The statement must, where appropriate, include references to and explanations of amounts in the annual accounts (src:5531)
GIVEN `it is appropriate to include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company's annual accounts` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(5) the statement must include references to and additional explanations of amounts in the annual accounts` MEANS
    IF `it is appropriate to include references to, and additional explanations of, amounts included in the company's annual accounts`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a "where" condition that fails, ruling of 2026-11-05 (b); fork F33): "where appropriate"

-- src:5532 | (6) If information required by subsections (1) to (5) to be included in the statement is published by the company by means of a national, EU-based or international reporting framework, the statement must specify the framework or frameworks used, instead of including that information.
@ref s 414CB(6) The statement must specify the reporting framework used instead of including the information (src:5532)
GIVEN `information required by subsections (1) to (5) is published by the company by means of a national, EU-based or international reporting framework` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(6) the statement must specify the framework or frameworks used instead of including the information` MEANS
    IF `information required by subsections (1) to (5) is published by the company by means of a national, EU-based or international reporting framework`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer; fork F33): "If information required by subsections (1) to (5) to be included in the statement is published by the company by means of a national, EU-based or international reporting framework, the statement must specify the framework or frameworks used"

@ref s 414CB(6) The statement must specify the reporting framework used instead of including the information (src:5532)
DECLARE `s 414CB(7) requirement that is treated as complied with` IS ONE OF
    `s 414CB(7)(a) section 414C(4)(b)`
    `s 414CB(7)(b) section 414C(7)`
    `s 414CB(7)(c) section 414C(8)(b)`
    `s 414CB(7)(d) section 414C(12)`

-- src:5533 | (7) If a non-financial and sustainability information statement complies with subsections (1) to (6), the strategic report of which it is part is to be treated as complying with the requirements in—
-- src:5534 | (a) section 414C(4)(b),
-- src:5535 | (b) section 414C(7), except as it relates to community issues,
-- src:5536 | (c) section 414C(8)(b), and
-- src:5537 | (d) section 414C(12), so far as relating to the provisions mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (c).
@ref s 414CB(7) A statement that complies with subsections (1) to (6) satisfies certain requirements of section 414C (src:5533-5537)
GIVEN `the statement complies with subsections (1) to (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirement relates to community issues` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirement relates to the provisions mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      requirement IS A `s 414CB(7) requirement that is treated as complied with`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(7) the strategic report is treated as complying with the requirement` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the statement complies with subsections (1) to (6)`)
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer; fork F33): "If a non-financial and sustainability information statement complies with subsections (1) to (6), the strategic report of which it is part is to be treated as complying with the requirements in"
    ELSE CONSIDER requirement
         WHEN `s 414CB(7)(a) section 414C(4)(b)` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 414CB(7)(b) section 414C(7)` THEN
             IF `the requirement relates to community issues`
             THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(b) section 414C(7), except as it relates to community issues"
             ELSE JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 414CB(7)(c) section 414C(8)(b)` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `s 414CB(7)(d) section 414C(12)` THEN
             IF `the requirement relates to the provisions mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (c)`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "so far as relating to the provisions mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (c)"

-- src:5538 | (8) In relation to a group non-financial and sustainability information statement, this section has effect as if the references to the company were references to the undertakings included in the consolidation.
@ref s 414CB(8) In relation to a group statement the section is read as if the company meant the undertakings included in the consolidation (src:5538)
GIVEN `the statement is a group non-financial and sustainability information statement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(8) a reference to the company in this section is read as a reference to the undertakings included in the consolidation` MEANS
    IF `the statement is a group non-financial and sustainability information statement`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In relation to a group non-financial and sustainability information statement"

-- src:5539 | (9) Nothing in this section requires the disclosure of information about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation if the disclosure would, in the opinion of the directors, be seriously prejudicial to the commercial interests of the company, provided that the non-disclosure does not prevent a fair and balanced understanding of the company’s development, performance or position or the impact of the company’s activity.
@ref s 414CB(9) Nothing in this section requires disclosure of prejudicial information, provided that fair and balanced understanding is not prevented (src:5539)
GIVEN `the information is about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the opinion of the directors the disclosure would be seriously prejudicial to the commercial interests of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the non-disclosure does not prevent a fair and balanced understanding of the company's development, performance or position or the impact of the company's activity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(9) this section requires the disclosure of the information` MEANS
    IF `the information is about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation`
       AND `in the opinion of the directors the disclosure would be seriously prejudicial to the commercial interests of the company`
       AND `the non-disclosure does not prevent a fair and balanced understanding of the company's development, performance or position or the impact of the company's activity`
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section requires the disclosure of information about impending developments or matters in the course of negotiation if the disclosure would, in the opinion of the directors, be seriously prejudicial to the commercial interests of the company, provided that the non-disclosure does not prevent a fair and balanced understanding"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection removes a requirement in one case and says nothing of the others

-- src:5540 | (10) The Secretary of State may issue guidance on the climate-related financial disclosures, which are described in subsection (2A), and otherwise in connection with the requirements of this section and section 414CA.
@ref s 414CB(10) The Secretary of State may issue guidance (src:5540)
GIVEN `the guidance is on the climate-related financial disclosures described in subsection (2A), or otherwise in connection with the requirements of section 414CB and section 414CA` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414CB(10) the Secretary of State may issue the guidance` MEANS
    IF `the guidance is on the climate-related financial disclosures described in subsection (2A), or otherwise in connection with the requirements of section 414CB and section 414CA`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is stated for guidance on those matters

-- =========================================================================================================
-- s 414D: Approval and signing of strategic report
-- =========================================================================================================

§ `s 414D Approval and signing of strategic report`

-- src:5541 | 414D Approval and signing of strategic report
-- src:5542 | (1) The strategic report must be approved by the board of directors and signed on behalf of the board by a director or the secretary of the company.
@ref s 414D(1) The strategic report must be approved by the board and signed on its behalf (src:5541-5542)
GIVEN `the strategic report has been approved by the board of directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the strategic report has been signed on behalf of the board by a director` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the strategic report has been signed on behalf of the board by the secretary of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414D(1) the strategic report has been approved and signed as required` MEANS
    IF `the strategic report has been approved by the board of directors`
       AND (`the strategic report has been signed on behalf of the board by a director` OR `the strategic report has been signed on behalf of the board by the secretary of the company`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a bare "must" not met, decided case by case, fork F9): "The strategic report must be approved by the board of directors and signed on behalf of the board by a director or the secretary of the company."

-- src:5543 | (2) If a strategic report is approved that does not comply with the requirements of this Act, every director of the company who—
-- src:5544 | (a) knew that it did not comply, or was reckless as to whether it complied, and
-- src:5545 | (b) failed to take reasonable steps to secure compliance with those requirements or, as the case may be, to prevent the report from being approved,
-- src:5546 | commits an offence.
@ref s 414D(2) A director who knowingly or recklessly lets a non-complying strategic report be approved commits an offence (src:5543-5546)
GIVEN `a strategic report is approved` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the approved report does not comply with the requirements of this Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a director of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the director knew that it did not comply` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the director was reckless as to whether it complied` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the director failed to take reasonable steps to secure compliance with those requirements or to prevent the report from being approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 414D(2) the director commits an offence` MEANS
    IF NOT (`a strategic report is approved` AND `the approved report does not comply with the requirements of this Act`)
    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", reading (a) for a lawyer): "If a strategic report is approved that does not comply with the requirements of this Act"
    ELSE IF `the person is a director of the company`
            AND (`the director knew that it did not comply` OR `the director was reckless as to whether it complied`)
            AND `the director failed to take reasonable steps to secure compliance with those requirements or to prevent the report from being approved`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "every director of the company who— (a) knew that it did not comply, or was reckless as to whether it complied, and (b) failed to take reasonable steps"

-- src:5547 | (3) A person guilty of an offence under this section is liable—
-- src:5548 | (a) on conviction on indictment, to a fine;
-- src:5549 | (b) on summary conviction, to a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum.
@ref s 414D(3) Penalty for an offence under section 414D (src:5547-5549)
GIVEN how IS A `Mode of conviction`
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 414D(3) the penalty for an offence under section 414D` MEANS
    CONSIDER how
    WHEN `on conviction on indictment` THEN JUST (Penalty OF `on conviction on indictment`, NOTHING, JUST `a fine without a stated limit`, NOTHING, FALSE)
    WHEN `on summary conviction` THEN JUST (Penalty OF `on summary conviction`, NOTHING, JUST (`a fine not exceeding the statutory maximum` 1), NOTHING, FALSE)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection distinguishes conviction on indictment from summary conviction and does not distinguish the parts of the United Kingdom
